# game/ch12.rpy:12
translate english ch12_93171b1c:

    # n "开学第一周，同桌换了一台最新款手机，全班都围过去看。阿狐越看越羡慕，自己的手机已经用了三年。"
    n "First week of the new term. His deskmate showed off the newest phone, and the whole class crowded around. The more Ahu looked, the more he envied — his own phone was three years old."

# game/ch12.rpy:13
translate english ch12_97c5f83b:

    # n "晚上刷视频，一条小广告弹了出来：「青春钱包——学生专享，零门槛秒借款，只需学生证，最快5分钟到账！」"
    n "That evening, a little ad popped up: \"Youth Wallet — student exclusive, zero-threshold instant loans, student ID only, cash in as fast as 5 minutes!\""

# game/ch12.rpy:14
translate english ch12_adfc3639:

    # think laugh "借3000块买手机，以后用零花钱慢慢还，好像很划算？"
    think laugh "Borrow 3,000 for a phone and repay slowly from my allowance... seems like a deal?"

# game/ch12.rpy:15
translate english ch12_8e540f7f:

    # n "阿狐点了进去，加上了「贷款客服」。"
    n "Ahu clicked in and added the \"loan support\"."

# game/ch12.rpy:18
translate english ch12_789523a0:

    # fraud laugh "同学好！学生专享通道，最高可借5000元，日息低至万分之五，一杯奶茶钱都不到！上传学生证和身份证照片就能开通，家长那边完全不用知道！"
    fraud laugh "Hi there! Student-exclusive channel — borrow up to 5,000 yuan at a daily rate as low as 0.05%%, less than a milk tea! Just upload your student ID and ID card photos to activate. Parents never need to know!"

# game/ch12.rpy:32
translate english ch12_A_0e1c7845:

    # n "「零门槛」「不用家长知道」这些字眼，让阿狐猛然想起班会课的内容。"
    n "The words \"zero threshold\" and \"parents never need to know\" jolted Ahu's memory of the class meeting."

# game/ch12.rpy:33
translate english ch12_A_a971b7dd:

    # think serious "老师说过：未成年人不能贷款，凡是面向学生的「网贷」，全都不正规！天上不会掉手机，掉下来的是陷阱！"
    think serious "Teacher said: minors cannot take out loans, and any \"online loan\" aimed at students is illegitimate! Phones don't fall from the sky — what falls is the trap!"

# game/ch12.rpy:34
translate english ch12_A_50d15f9c:

    # mc serious "未成年人不能借贷，这种小广告违法，我不碰！"
    mc serious "Minors can't borrow, and ads like this are illegal. I won't touch it!"

# game/ch12.rpy:35
translate english ch12_A_f925895a:

    # n "阿狐截图举报了广告，第二天还把这事告诉了班主任。老师在班会上专门讲了「校园贷」的危害，提醒全班同学。"
    n "Ahu screenshot-reported the ad and told his head teacher the next day. She devoted a class meeting to the dangers of \"campus loans\", warning the whole class."

# game/ch12.rpy:38
translate english ch12_A_7a8c209c:

    # police laugh "非常棒！「校园贷」专门盯着想要新手机、新球鞋的学生：零门槛是鱼饵，利滚利是深渊。记住：缺钱找爸妈，贷款绝不能碰！"
    police laugh "Excellent! \"Campus loans\" target students wanting new phones and sneakers: zero threshold is the bait, compound interest the abyss. Remember: short on money, talk to Mom and Dad — never touch loans!"

# game/ch12.rpy:50
translate english ch12_B_d7e3d877:

    # mc confused "我是未成年人，不用家长同意，真的能借钱吗？"
    mc confused "I'm a minor — can I really borrow money without parental consent?"

# game/ch12.rpy:51
translate english ch12_B_eea641bc:

    # fraud laugh "当然能！我们是「学生特殊通道」，不看征信、不联系家长。只要上传身份证照片，再填一下爸妈的电话「做登记」，秒批！"
    fraud laugh "Of course! We're a \"student special channel\" — no credit checks, no contacting parents. Just upload your ID photo and fill in your parents' numbers \"for registration\". Instant approval!"

# game/ch12.rpy:52
translate english ch12_B_66bc5ed3:

    # n "对方发来几张「学生借款成功到账」的截图，还有人晒出了新手机。"
    n "The scammer sent several \"student loan received\" screenshots — some even showing off new phones."

# game/ch12.rpy:53
translate english ch12_B_338274df:

    # fraud serious "今天开通还有新人红包500元抵扣券，名额只剩10个了！"
    fraud serious "Activate today and get a 500-yuan newcomer voucher — only 10 spots left!"

# game/ch12.rpy:67
translate english ch12_B1_2c95a7c6:

    # n "阿狐拿着手机走到客厅找爸爸。"
    n "Ahu took his phone to the living room to find Dad."

# game/ch12.rpy:68
translate english ch12_B1_a5745273:

    # think worried "「不用家长知道」这句话，怎么听怎么别扭……还是先问爸爸。"
    think worried "The words \"parents never need to know\" feel wrong however I hear them... Ask Dad first."

# game/ch12.rpy:69
translate english ch12_B1_90ae461b:

    # mc worried "爸爸，有个APP说学生能零门槛借款，不用家长同意，是真的吗？"
    mc worried "Dad, an APP says students can take zero-threshold loans without parental consent. Is that real?"

# game/ch12.rpy:70
translate english ch12_B1_c1df037e:

    # dad serious "儿子，这是「校园贷」骗局！未成年人法律上根本不能借贷，这种平台全是违法的。你看「日息万分之五」，实际算下来年利息高得吓人，借3000能滚成上万！"
    dad serious "Son, this is a \"campus loan\" scam! Minors legally cannot borrow at all — platforms like this are illegal. That \"0.05%% daily rate\" compounds into a terrifying annual interest: 3,000 borrowed can snowball past 10,000!"

# game/ch12.rpy:71
translate english ch12_B1_d1a64881:

    # n "爸爸陪阿狐举报了广告，还给他算了笔利滚利的账。阿狐看完倒吸一口凉气。"
    n "Dad helped Ahu report the ad and walked him through the compound-interest math. Ahu gasped at the numbers."

# game/ch12.rpy:74
translate english ch12_B1_020db023:

    # police laugh "问家长问对了！校园贷的本质是「高利贷陷阱」，专门坑没收入的学生。记住：身份证不能交、网贷不能碰、缺钱和家人商量！"
    police laugh "Right to ask! Campus loans are \"loan-shark traps\" targeting students with no income. Remember: never hand over your ID, never touch online loans, discuss money troubles with family!"

# game/ch12.rpy:86
translate english ch12_B2_634e22c0:

    # mc serious "身份证照片不能随便给。你们这种「不用家长知道」的贷款，一听就不正规，我不借了。"
    mc serious "ID photos can't be handed out casually. A loan that \"skips parents\" sounds shady from the start — I'm not borrowing."

# game/ch12.rpy:87
translate english ch12_B2_22a3c7f0:

    # fraud serious "上传而已怕什么！没身份证就别怪平台没给你机会，红包名额马上没了！"
    fraud serious "It's just an upload — what's to fear! No ID, no opportunity — don't blame the platform. The voucher spots are almost gone!"

# game/ch12.rpy:88
translate english ch12_B2_6c2a48be:

    # think serious "越是催我交身份证的，越可疑。不传就是不传！"
    think serious "The harder they push for my ID, the more suspicious. No means no!"

# game/ch12.rpy:89
translate english ch12_B2_5d307d5b:

    # n "阿狐卸载了链接，举报了广告。后来新闻里报道了同款「青春钱包」骗局：学生上传证件后被冒名网贷、暴力催收。"
    n "Ahu deleted the link and reported the ad. Later the news covered the same \"Youth Wallet\" scam: students who uploaded IDs got loans taken out in their names, followed by violent debt collection."

# game/ch12.rpy:92
translate english ch12_B2_21c334e1:

    # police serious "守住身份证，就守住了底线！身份证照片一旦落入骗子手里，可能被冒名注册网贷、办卡，后患无穷。"
    police serious "Guard your ID card and you guard the bottom line! Once ID photos fall into scammers' hands, they can be used for loans and cards in your name — endless trouble."

# game/ch12.rpy:104
translate english ch12_B3_91821128:

    # n "阿狐按提示上传了身份证照片，还填了爸爸妈妈的电话号码。"
    n "Ahu uploaded his ID photos as prompted and filled in his parents' phone numbers."

# game/ch12.rpy:105
translate english ch12_B3_2723d069:

    # n "刚提交，「客服」却发来消息：审核需先缴纳200元「工本费」，缴纳后3000元立刻放款。"
    n "Right after submitting, \"support\" messaged: review requires a 200-yuan \"processing fee\" first — pay it and the 3,000 yuan releases instantly."

# game/ch12.rpy:106
translate english ch12_B3_267e6626:

    # think serious "等等！老师说，放款前先收费的都是诈骗！"
    think serious "Wait! Teacher said anyone charging fees before the loan lands is a scammer!"

# game/ch12.rpy:107
translate english ch12_B3_e7e64d18:

    # mc serious "我不交了！你们是假的！"
    mc serious "I'm not paying! You're fake!"

# game/ch12.rpy:108
translate english ch12_B3_20acd105:

    # n "阿狐马上告诉爸爸。爸爸联系了相关平台投诉并报警备案——身份证照片已泄露，后续要格外提防冒名贷款。"
    n "Ahu told Dad immediately. Dad complained to the platform and filed a police report — the ID photos had leaked, so watch for loans taken in his name."

# game/ch12.rpy:111
translate english ch12_B3_c329d542:

    # police serious "好险！身份证信息已经泄露，骗子可能拿去冒名借款。记住两条铁律：放款先收费是诈骗，身份证照片不外传！"
    police serious "Close call! The ID information leaked — scammers could borrow in his name. Two iron rules: fees before a loan is fraud, and ID photos never leave your hands!"

# game/ch12.rpy:123
translate english ch12_C_1bd4faa7:

    # n "阿狐上传了身份证照片，填好资料，申请了3000元借款。"
    n "Ahu uploaded his ID photos, filled in the forms, and applied for a 3,000-yuan loan."

# game/ch12.rpy:124
translate english ch12_C_ce2b1730:

    # think laugh "5分钟到账，明天就能带新手机去学校了！"
    think laugh "Cash in 5 minutes — I'll bring the new phone to school tomorrow!"

# game/ch12.rpy:125
translate english ch12_C_722eff07:

    # fraud laugh "恭喜，你的借款申请已通过初审！放款前最后一步：缴纳300元「会员费」激活账户，缴费后额度秒到！"
    fraud laugh "Congratulations — your loan passed initial review! One last step before payout: pay a 300-yuan \"membership fee\" to activate your account, and the credit arrives instantly!"

# game/ch12.rpy:140
translate english ch12_C1_717b9464:

    # n "看着「缴费激活」的要求，阿狐心里突然咯噔一下。"
    n "Seeing the \"pay to activate\" demand, Ahu's heart suddenly skipped."

# game/ch12.rpy:141
translate english ch12_C1_736c99d4:

    # think serious "不对！正规贷款是平台把钱给我，哪有借款人先给平台交钱的？老师说过，放款前收费的一律是诈骗！"
    think serious "Wait! A real loan means the platform gives ME money — since when does the borrower pay the platform first? Teacher said: fees before payout are always fraud!"

# game/ch12.rpy:142
translate english ch12_C1_eb9a840f:

    # mc serious "我不交钱，也不借了！未成年人借贷本来就不合法，你们这是欺诈，我要举报你们！"
    mc serious "I'm not paying, and I'm not borrowing! Loans for minors are illegal anyway — this is fraud, and I'm reporting you!"

# game/ch12.rpy:143
translate english ch12_C1_01023759:

    # n "阿狐截图保留证据，退出平台，把整件事告诉爸爸。爸爸帮他向平台举报，并向反诈中心备案。"
    n "Ahu kept screenshots as evidence, left the platform, and told Dad everything. Dad reported to the platform and filed with the anti-fraud center."

# game/ch12.rpy:146
translate english ch12_C1_dfc09671:

    # police serious "识破「合同违约金」的恐吓话术，非常出色！记住：贷款没到手先交钱的，全是诈骗；什么「违约金」「生效合同」，都是吓唬你的！"
    police serious "Seeing through the \"contract penalty\" intimidation — outstanding! Remember: any fee before the loan lands is fraud. \"Penalties\" and \"active contracts\" are just scare tactics!"

# game/ch12.rpy:159
translate english ch12_C2_9db72c87:

    # think laugh "300元换3000元借款，忍一忍就过去了。"
    think laugh "300 yuan for a 3,000-yuan loan — hold my nose and it's over."

# game/ch12.rpy:160
translate english ch12_C2_4f6409cf:

    # n "缴费成功，对方却又发来通知：账户风控异常，需再缴800元「解冻金」才能放款，已缴费用不予退还。"
    n "Payment succeeded — then another notice: account risk control abnormal. Pay another 800-yuan \"unfreezing fee\" for the payout; fees paid are non-refundable."

# game/ch12.rpy:161
translate english ch12_C2_b8d89879:

    # mc confused "怎么交完会员费又冒出解冻金？"
    mc confused "Membership fee paid, now an unfreezing fee appears?"

# game/ch12.rpy:162
translate english ch12_C2_70711476:

    # n "阿狐终于醒悟，把一切告诉爸爸。爸爸报警备案，300元已无法追回。"
    n "Ahu finally came to his senses and told Dad everything. Dad filed a police report — the 300 yuan was unrecoverable."

# game/ch12.rpy:165
translate english ch12_C2_9c9b46d0:

    # police serious "「校园贷」骗局专挑怕担责的孩子下手，用「违约金」吓你继续掏钱。记住：被吓住就转账，正中骗子下怀；告诉家长，才是唯一出路！"
    police serious "\"Campus loan\" scams target kids afraid of responsibility, using \"penalties\" to scare them into paying. Remember: transferring out of fear plays right into the scammer's hands — telling your parents is the only way out!"

# game/ch12.rpy:178
translate english ch12_C3_76ed64cb:

    # n "借款始终没到账，欠款「账单」却越滚越大：平台发来恐吓消息，说要上门催收、通知学校、打爆爸妈电话。"
    n "The loan never arrived, but the \"debt\" snowballed: the platform sent threatening messages about door-to-door collection, notifying the school, and ringing his parents off the hook."

# game/ch12.rpy:179
translate english ch12_C3_98f7c9f7:

    # n "阿狐不敢告诉家人，偷偷把攒的压岁钱和零花钱全填了进去，前前后后被骗走2600元，手机没买成，整个人恍恍惚惚。"
    n "Not daring to tell his family, Ahu quietly poured in all his saved New Year money and allowance — 2,600 yuan lost in total. No phone, and he drifted through days in a daze."

# game/ch12.rpy:180
translate english ch12_C3_966ad78e:

    # n "直到班主任发现他上课总走神，耐心询问，他才哭着说出实情。老师和家长立刻报警。"
    n "Not until his head teacher noticed him drifting off in class and asked patiently did he reveal the truth in tears. The teacher and parents reported to the police immediately."

# game/ch12.rpy:181
translate english ch12_C3_423b1b36:

    # mc sad "我不该碰什么校园贷的……越陷越深，好可怕……"
    mc sad "I never should have touched that campus loan... it just got deeper and deeper. So scary..."

# game/ch12.rpy:182
translate english ch12_C3_3c4df80c:

    # mom normal "不怪你，是骗子太坏。以后缺什么、想要什么，都跟爸爸妈妈说，咱们一起想办法。"
    mom normal "It's not your fault — the scammers are vile. From now on, whatever you need or want, tell Mom and Dad and we'll figure it out together."

# game/ch12.rpy:185
translate english ch12_C3_2b645c3c:

    # police serious "小朋友记住！「校园贷」零门槛的背后是无底洞：先收费、再恐吓、越滚越多。未成年人绝不借贷，遇到威胁马上告诉家长和老师，警察会保护你！"
    police serious "Kids, remember! Behind \"zero-threshold\" campus loans is a bottomless pit: fees first, intimidation next, debt snowballing. Minors must never borrow. Threatened? Tell your parents and teachers right away — the police will protect you!"

