# game/ch12.rpy:126
translate english ch12_C_065abcae:

    # fraud serious "注意：不缴费视为放弃借款，但合同已生效，将按借款金额的30%%收取违约金！"
    fraud serious "Note: not paying counts as abandoning the loan — but the contract is already in effect, and a penalty of 30%% of the amount will be charged!"

# game/ch12.rpy:158
translate english ch12_C2_697687f5:

    # n "阿狐怕被收30%%违约金，咬牙交了300元「会员费」。"
    n "Terrified of the 30%% penalty, Ahu gritted his teeth and paid the 300-yuan \"membership fee\"."

# game/ch12.rpy:177
translate english ch12_C3_105c5337:

    # n "阿狐被「30%%违约金」吓住，先交了300元会员费，又交了800元解冻金、500元「征信保险费」……"
    n "Terrified by the \"30%% penalty\", Ahu paid the 300-yuan membership fee, then an 800-yuan unfreezing fee, then a 500-yuan \"credit insurance fee\"..."

# TODO: Translation updated at 2026-09-07 11:03

# game/ch12.rpy:34
translate english ch12_A_d0cbd2cd:

    # n "开学第一课的班会上，猫头鹰老师敲着黑板强调过这件事。"
    n "At the very first class meeting of the term, the owl teacher had rapped the blackboard to drive this home."

# game/ch12.rpy:35
translate english ch12_A_f00b7f3a:

    # teacher serious "「零门槛」「不用家长知道」的学生贷款，全是陷阱！借三千能滚成一万。记住：缺钱，就跟爸爸妈妈说！"
    teacher serious "\"Zero-threshold\" student loans that \"skip your parents\" are all traps! Borrow 3,000 and it snowballs past 10,000. Remember: if you're short on money, talk to your mom and dad!"

